act-ff5e9870-9c72-4f65-b3f6-7afd45424c44"/><span class="pf-paragraph-content ">Constructed with the updated heat-resistant materials and super capacitor, D600Pro dash camera performs reliably even in extreme temperatures(-4°F~158°F). The reinforced bracket design enhances stability, keeping the dash camera recording angle secure and steady even on bumpy roads.</span></p></div></div></div><div class="sc-guJBQA cZycXH pf-48_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px;position:relative" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-edLa-Dd dImQiY pf-49_"><img alt="D600pro-14.jpg__PID:edb8de6a-0049-4f2f-ba29-23a87b7cc20b" src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0637/6135/0883/files/D600pro-14.jpg?v=1719393945&width=2048" srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0637/6135/0883/files/D600pro-14.jpg?v=1719393945&width=375 375w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0637/6135/0883/files/D600pro-14.jpg?v=1719393945&width=550 550w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0637/6135/0883/files/D600pro-14.jpg?v=1719393945&width=768 768w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0637/6135/0883/files/D600pro-14.jpg?v=1719393945&width=1024 1024w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0637/6135/0883/files/D600pro-14.jpg?v=1719393945&width=1280 1280w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0637/6135/0883/files/D600pro-14.jpg?v=1719393945&width=1440 1440w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0637/6135/0883/files/D600pro-14.jpg?v=1719393945&width=1680 1680w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0637/6135/0883/files/D600pro-14.jpg?v=1719393945&width=1800 1800w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0637/6135/0883/files/D600pro-14.jpg?v=1719393945&width=1920 1920w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0637/6135/0883/files/D600pro-14.jpg?v=1719393945&width=2048 2048w" fetchPriority="low" decoding="async" loading="lazy" style="--pf-image-ratio:2.44" width="1464" height="600" sizes="75vw" data-pf-type="Image4" class="sc-dwamxw foBSaC pf-50_" store="[object Object]"/></div