raph4"><input type="checkbox" id="compact-95129ea6-4f61-46ac-96f5-db2b98103d83"/><span class="pf-paragraph-content ">This 4K dash cam provides various voice prompts to keep you informed of its current status, such as start recording, stop recording,please format the SD card and etc. If a collision reaches your set G-sensor level, the smart dash camera emits a "video locked" sound, securing and saving the video in the lock folder. You can adjust the volume or disable the voice prompt feature according to your preference.</span></p></div></div></div><div class="sc-guJBQA cZycXH pf-84_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px;position:relative" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-edLa-Dd dImQiY pf-85_"><img alt="D600pro-18.jpg__PID:8609857c-9ce7-4338-9c27-15c4db37c9ab" src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0637/6135/0883/files/D600pro-18.jpg?v=1719394743&width=2048" srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0637/6135/0883/files/D600pro-18.jpg?v=1719394743&width=375 375w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0637/6135/0883/files/D600pro-18.jpg?v=1719394743&width=550 550w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0637/6135/0883/files/D600pro-18.jpg?v=1719394743&width=768 768w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0637/6135/0883/files/D600pro-18.jpg?v=1719394743&width=1024 1024w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0637/6135/0883/files/D600pro-18.jpg?v=1719394743&width=1280 1280w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0637/6135/0883/files/D600pro-18.jpg?v=1719394743&width=1440 1440w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0637/6135/0883/files/D600pro-18.jpg?v=1719394743&width=1680 1680w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0637/6135/0883/files/D600pro-18.jpg?v=1719394743&width=1800 1800w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0637/6135/0883/files/D600pro-18.jpg?v=1719394743&width=1920 1920w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0637/6135/0883/files/D600pro-18.jpg?v=1719394743&width=2048 2048w" fetchPriority="low" decoding="async" loadi